1792431608.223	AFS power test firmware - press any key within 2 s for the console
1792431608.235	commands:
1792431608.236	  show                    print configuration
1792431608.246	  set <key> <value>       keys: sleep fill settle measure drain dry gnss reg move
1792431608.247	                          ncycles cpu modem gnssen force apn host port path
1792431608.258	  cycle                   run one full cycle now, stay awake
1792431608.258	  auto                    cycle -> deep sleep(sleep) -> cycle ... (ncycles, 0=forever)
1792431608.269	  step <name>             hold one subsystem on until any key
1792431608.269	  sleep <s>               deep sleep for s seconds, then back to this console
1792431608.280	  modem on|off            power the SIM7000G up/down
1792431608.280	  at <command>            send a raw AT command
1792431608.291	  echo on|off             show AT traffic
1792431608.291	  vbat                    battery and solar voltage
1792431608.291	  read [n]                print all analog inputs n times (1 s apart)
